WEBVTT

00:30.923 --> 00:34.473
♪ Pink hands so fine ♪

00:34.493 --> 00:37.873
♪ Gold-branded wine ♪

00:38.143 --> 00:44.113
♪ Spring paints willows green;
palace walls can't confine ♪

00:45.273 --> 00:48.903
♪ East wind unfair ♪

00:48.923 --> 00:52.433
♪ Happy times rare ♪

00:52.453 --> 00:55.943
♪ In my heart, sad thoughts throng ♪

00:55.963 --> 00:59.473
♪ We've severed for years long ♪

00:59.493 --> 01:05.553
♪ Wrong, wrong, wrong ♪

01:18.813 --> 01:23.093
Si Jin

01:23.113 --> 01:27.093
Episode 3

01:27.093 --> 01:32.013
(Capital Security Office)

01:33.023 --> 01:34.943
I'm Sun Qiaoniang.

01:35.583 --> 01:37.223
Greetings, Your Honor.

01:37.583 --> 01:38.803
Sun Qiaoniang.

01:38.823 --> 01:40.383
Let me ask you.

01:40.873 --> 01:42.943
Did Ji Chongyi

01:42.943 --> 01:44.163
push Jiang into the water?

01:44.183 --> 01:47.053
Qiaoniang, speak the truth.

01:47.073 --> 01:49.123
With me here, you have nothing to fear.

01:53.223 --> 01:55.633
Since you want to marry Young Master Ji,

01:55.743 --> 01:57.663
I'll help you.

01:58.153 --> 01:59.813
Even if you marry him now,

01:59.833 --> 02:01.253
you'll only be a concubine.

02:01.273 --> 02:03.823
But if you're willing to testify,

02:04.303 --> 02:05.793
I'll help you

02:05.903 --> 02:07.233
become the respected wife

02:07.233 --> 02:09.593
of Young Master Ji.

02:10.153 --> 02:11.823
Will you trust me this time?

02:14.993 --> 02:16.383
Your Honor,

02:17.063 --> 02:18.593
that night,

02:19.233 --> 02:21.663
Young Master Ji did push Jiang Si.

02:23.463 --> 02:26.323
Qiaoniang, what are you saying?

02:26.343 --> 02:27.983
Are you crazy?

02:28.183 --> 02:29.323
Ji Chongyi,

02:29.343 --> 02:31.563
if you continue
to make a scene in court,

02:31.583 --> 02:32.543
I'll charge you

02:32.543 --> 02:34.423
with contempt of court.

02:34.623 --> 02:35.853
(Smart girl.)

02:35.873 --> 02:37.563
(Turning enemies into friends.)

02:37.583 --> 02:38.953
(The rival's testimony)

02:38.953 --> 02:41.103
(is more believable than others'.)

02:41.273 --> 02:44.283
(Jiang Si, you're truly something.)

02:44.303 --> 02:45.813
Let me ask you again.

02:45.833 --> 02:49.263
Did Ji Chongyi do it by accident

02:49.303 --> 02:51.073
or on purpose?

02:52.183 --> 02:53.943
He...

02:58.153 --> 02:59.513
Don't be afraid.

03:00.063 --> 03:01.543
Speak the truth.

03:01.783 --> 03:02.693
Qiaoniang.

03:02.713 --> 03:04.153
I didn't push her on purpose.

03:04.153 --> 03:04.993
You saw it clearly

03:04.993 --> 03:06.113
behind me.

03:06.113 --> 03:07.953
It was just an accident.

03:07.953 --> 03:09.373
Young Master Ji,

03:09.393 --> 03:10.853
so you admit it now.

03:10.873 --> 03:12.873
You did push me into the water.

03:12.873 --> 03:13.713
I didn't.

03:13.723 --> 03:14.893
I didn't push you on purpose.

03:14.893 --> 03:16.063
- What an obvious lie.
- I...

03:16.063 --> 03:17.653
How dare you lie to me.

03:17.673 --> 03:18.463
Take him out

03:18.483 --> 03:19.663
for ten strokes of the cane.

03:19.663 --> 03:20.323
Yes.

03:20.343 --> 03:21.443
Don't touch me.

03:21.463 --> 03:22.673
My father is Duke An.

03:22.673 --> 03:23.993
You can't touch me.

03:23.993 --> 03:25.393
They've teamed up

03:25.393 --> 03:27.113
to force me to break off the engagement.

03:27.133 --> 03:28.383
- I'm innocent.
- Look at him.

03:28.393 --> 03:30.113
- Your Honor.
- He did do it.

03:30.303 --> 03:31.663
Chongli!

03:32.433 --> 03:34.163
Your Honor, please show mercy.

03:34.183 --> 03:35.793
Who are you?

03:35.903 --> 03:37.973
I'm Ji Chongli, son of Duke An,

03:37.993 --> 03:39.873
here to plead for Ji Chongyi.

03:42.153 --> 03:44.253
Your Honor, I'm innocent.

03:44.273 --> 03:45.463
Jiang Si and Qiaoniang

03:45.463 --> 03:46.543
have teamed up to lie,

03:46.543 --> 03:48.113
forcing me to break off the engagement.

03:48.113 --> 03:49.913
Everything I said is true.

03:49.913 --> 03:51.823
I'm innocent, Your Honor.

03:53.433 --> 03:54.653
Hit him harder.

03:54.673 --> 03:55.733
Well done.

03:55.753 --> 03:56.823
- Well done.
- Well done.

03:56.823 --> 03:58.603
This is the Capital Security Office.

03:58.623 --> 04:00.023
Whether you're a prince

04:00.023 --> 04:01.653
or a commoner,

04:01.673 --> 04:04.603
I treat everyone equally.

04:04.623 --> 04:06.753
Only right and wrong matter here.

04:08.703 --> 04:10.063
Chongli.

04:12.383 --> 04:14.413
Your Honor, I'm innocent.

04:14.433 --> 04:15.793
They're framing me.

04:15.793 --> 04:18.383
Qiaoniang, continue.

04:25.113 --> 04:26.473
Your Honor.

04:31.823 --> 04:33.263
He...

04:43.183 --> 04:44.873
How is my acting?

04:45.873 --> 04:48.233
Perfect.

04:51.503 --> 04:52.593
It's been a long day.

04:52.593 --> 04:53.453
Here.

04:53.473 --> 04:55.313
Drink this antiabortifacient.

04:58.143 --> 04:59.333
It's not hot.

04:59.353 --> 05:00.453
Qiaoniang.

05:00.473 --> 05:01.873
Qiaoniang.

05:02.383 --> 05:03.743
Bring that vile woman out here.

05:03.743 --> 05:05.783
Stop hiding. Come out.

05:05.823 --> 05:06.923
Young Master Ji,

05:06.943 --> 05:08.333
what are you doing?

05:08.353 --> 05:09.723
You're here,

05:09.743 --> 05:11.113
so Jiang Si must be here too.

05:11.113 --> 05:12.503
Hurry up and bring her out.

05:12.503 --> 05:13.773
Go.

05:13.793 --> 05:14.683
Stay here.

05:14.703 --> 05:15.543
I know you're here.

05:15.543 --> 05:16.893
Hurry up and come out.

05:16.913 --> 05:18.383
Where are they?

05:19.593 --> 05:20.923
Young Master Ji,

05:20.943 --> 05:23.113
it seems you haven't had enough
of the cane.

05:23.113 --> 05:25.123
You can even question me here now.

05:25.143 --> 05:26.953
You and Qiaoniang are truly venomous.

05:26.953 --> 05:28.753
What a trick.

05:28.823 --> 05:31.283
One acted dumb in court;

05:31.303 --> 05:33.213
the other twisted the truth.

05:33.233 --> 05:34.353
In the end,

05:34.353 --> 05:35.643
you two teamed up to frame me.

05:35.643 --> 05:37.483
You were playing two girls
at the same time,

05:37.503 --> 05:39.233
trying to trick me, a pure young lady,

05:39.233 --> 05:41.283
into marrying you.

05:41.303 --> 05:42.823
Can't I retaliate?

05:42.823 --> 05:43.923
You...

05:43.943 --> 05:45.013
Duchess An,

05:45.033 --> 05:46.673
is this how you teach your son?

05:46.673 --> 05:48.033
Enough.

05:48.143 --> 05:50.573
My son is an excellent man.

05:50.593 --> 05:52.873
You should be glad if he likes you.

05:54.303 --> 05:55.903
You vile woman.

05:55.943 --> 05:57.033
What did she

05:57.033 --> 05:58.333
do to you

05:58.353 --> 05:59.633
to make you frame my son

05:59.633 --> 06:01.263
in court?

06:01.793 --> 06:04.013
As it has come to this,

06:04.033 --> 06:05.973
none of you

06:05.993 --> 06:07.473
can marry my son.

06:07.473 --> 06:09.213
Duchess An, how condescending.

06:09.233 --> 06:10.433
At this point,

06:10.433 --> 06:12.123
you still can't face the reality, huh?

06:12.143 --> 06:13.183
I never intended

06:13.183 --> 06:14.413
to marry your son.

06:14.433 --> 06:16.143
But Qiaoniang...

06:16.823 --> 06:19.313
Qiaoniang, sit down first.

06:21.703 --> 06:23.093
But Qiaoniang

06:23.113 --> 06:24.033
is now carrying

06:24.033 --> 06:25.783
your son's child.

06:28.183 --> 06:29.163
This...

06:29.183 --> 06:30.543
This...

06:30.593 --> 06:32.993
She's pregnant?

06:32.993 --> 06:35.603
She must have an ulterior motive.

06:35.623 --> 06:37.183
You want to use the child

06:37.183 --> 06:38.453
to threaten me.

06:38.473 --> 06:40.603
You're a lowly businesswoman.

06:40.623 --> 06:42.303
Who knows

06:42.303 --> 06:44.063
who has frequented your shop

06:44.063 --> 06:45.143
and had dealings with you?

06:45.143 --> 06:46.153
How can you claim

06:46.153 --> 06:47.893
the child is mine?

06:47.913 --> 06:49.183
I saw

06:49.183 --> 06:50.223
how eloquent you are

06:50.223 --> 06:51.633
in court today.

06:51.913 --> 06:53.803
You can turn black into white.

06:53.823 --> 06:55.923
But I am a solitary woman,

06:55.943 --> 06:58.023
with nothing to be threatened by.

06:58.043 --> 06:59.753
Whether you accept it or not,

06:59.823 --> 07:01.513
this child will bear

07:01.823 --> 07:03.213
the Ji surname.

07:03.233 --> 07:04.893
I believe Mr. Zhen

07:04.913 --> 07:05.983
and the people in the city

07:05.983 --> 07:07.263
can see clearly the relationship

07:07.263 --> 07:08.603
between your son and me.

07:08.623 --> 07:10.333
If anything happens to me,

07:10.353 --> 07:12.683
the primary suspect will be your family.

07:12.703 --> 07:14.263
It's not so easy for you

07:14.263 --> 07:15.943
to marry my son.

07:15.943 --> 07:18.123
You've truly opened my eyes today.

07:18.143 --> 07:19.303
I thought if you knew

07:19.303 --> 07:20.503
Qiaoniang was pregnant,

07:20.503 --> 07:22.453
you'd care about family ties.

07:22.473 --> 07:23.473
But to my surprise,

07:23.473 --> 07:25.453
you're so heartless and cruel.

07:25.473 --> 07:26.473
I understand.

07:26.473 --> 07:28.213
If word gets out later

07:28.233 --> 07:30.473
that Young Master Ji
wanted to marry Qiaoniang

07:30.473 --> 07:31.623
for her wealth

07:31.623 --> 07:33.673
instead of love

07:33.673 --> 07:35.653
to repay his gambling debts,

07:35.673 --> 07:37.583
no one would find it strange.

07:37.743 --> 07:39.853
Why did you tell her everything?

07:39.873 --> 07:41.973
You tried to trick me into marrying you

07:41.993 --> 07:44.013
because you wanted to find a big fool.

07:44.033 --> 07:45.123
But I'm sure

07:45.143 --> 07:48.553
the Duke doesn't know this, right?

07:49.233 --> 07:50.383
What do you want?

07:50.383 --> 07:52.043
I want a Letter of Annulment.

07:52.063 --> 07:53.993
Qiaoniang wants a Letter of Marriage,

07:53.993 --> 07:56.673
and she wants to be the wife.

07:56.793 --> 07:58.673
I think you've lost your mind.

07:58.943 --> 08:00.823
She's a lowly businesswoman.

08:00.823 --> 08:03.073
How could you dream of that?

08:04.703 --> 08:05.793
Your son

08:05.793 --> 08:06.943
had his eyes

08:06.943 --> 08:08.583
on my wealth.

08:08.913 --> 08:11.383
I can pay his debt.

08:11.433 --> 08:14.233
Stop dreaming.

08:16.143 --> 08:17.333
Young Master Ji,

08:17.353 --> 08:18.913
you really have a good mother.

08:18.913 --> 08:20.723
I truly envy you.

08:20.743 --> 08:22.363
But now, it's come to this.

08:22.383 --> 08:23.513
Either you two

08:23.513 --> 08:24.973
agree to our terms,

08:24.993 --> 08:27.483
or you'll have to tell

08:27.503 --> 08:28.423
Mr. Zhen in court

08:28.423 --> 08:29.953
how you tried

08:29.953 --> 08:31.263
to steal from your lover,

08:31.263 --> 08:32.783
how you plotted to kill your fiancée,

08:32.783 --> 08:34.473
and how you turned your back on her

08:34.473 --> 08:36.883
now that she's pregnant.

08:36.903 --> 08:38.933
If it really comes to that,

08:38.953 --> 08:41.973
your bright future as an official

08:41.993 --> 08:43.423
will probably be

08:43.423 --> 08:45.353
a delusion

08:45.353 --> 08:47.423
for Young Master Ji.

08:47.993 --> 08:50.783
What a cruel scheme.

08:51.713 --> 08:54.423
You two are trying to ruin me.

08:57.683 --> 09:00.233
Mother, save me.

09:03.843 --> 09:07.513
You've made one mistake after another.

09:08.993 --> 09:11.833
Even if I agree
to let her be my son's wife,

09:12.073 --> 09:14.753
the Duke will never approve.

09:16.713 --> 09:18.833
Duchess, as I know,

09:18.833 --> 09:21.293
you were once a concubine too.

09:21.313 --> 09:23.233
Now, aren't you also

09:23.233 --> 09:24.643
the Duke's wife?

09:24.663 --> 09:26.123
I believe

09:26.143 --> 09:28.383
you'll figure something out.

09:47.903 --> 09:49.093
Miss,

09:49.113 --> 09:49.993
didn't Ms. Wei

09:49.993 --> 09:51.893
agree to the annulment?

09:51.913 --> 09:52.753
Why do you still look

09:52.753 --> 09:54.723
so troubled?

09:54.743 --> 09:57.063
Until we have the Letter of Annulment,

09:57.233 --> 09:59.233
there will always be uncertainty.

10:00.073 --> 10:02.233
How can I feel at ease?

10:03.593 --> 10:04.873
I'm wondering how Father is doing

10:04.873 --> 10:06.573
with the handover

10:06.593 --> 10:08.233
at Duke An's Mansion.

10:10.423 --> 10:13.113
I hope nothing unexpected happens.

10:15.993 --> 10:17.483
Since falling into the water,

10:17.503 --> 10:19.123
you've changed a lot.

10:19.143 --> 10:20.453
Why?

10:20.473 --> 10:23.593
You never painted landscape art.

10:25.623 --> 10:26.463
Is that so?

10:26.473 --> 10:27.313
Yes.

10:27.323 --> 10:28.193
Look.

10:28.193 --> 10:29.603
These, these,

10:29.623 --> 10:30.643
and this,

10:30.663 --> 10:32.233
are all flower and bird paintings

10:32.233 --> 10:33.873
you used to make.

10:34.623 --> 10:36.293
(After I married Ji Chongyi, )

10:36.313 --> 10:38.353
(I faced so many difficulties)

10:38.663 --> 10:40.403
(and ended up in the South.)

10:40.423 --> 10:41.993
(It gave me a chance)

10:41.993 --> 10:44.633
(to see the grand landscape
outside Ling'an.)

10:44.903 --> 10:45.823
(If a woman)

10:45.823 --> 10:47.733
(is trapped in the inner chamber, )

10:47.873 --> 10:49.263
(appreciating flowers and birds)

10:49.263 --> 10:50.883
(and idling away, )

10:50.903 --> 10:52.643
(what else could she paint)

10:52.663 --> 10:54.293
(but flowers and birds?)

10:54.313 --> 10:56.663
But the landscape in this painting

10:56.663 --> 10:57.853
is quite unique.

10:57.873 --> 10:58.873
I've never seen

10:58.873 --> 11:00.173
such scenery in Ling'an.

11:00.193 --> 11:01.903
Miss, where is this from?

11:03.423 --> 11:05.473
I painted it

11:07.313 --> 11:08.783
from a dream I had.

11:08.993 --> 11:10.693
- Si.
- Si.

11:10.713 --> 11:11.873
- Si.
- Si.

11:11.873 --> 11:14.353
Look what we brought.

11:15.933 --> 11:17.813
(Ji Chongyi, Jiang Si)

11:17.833 --> 11:18.833
A Letter of Annulment.

11:18.833 --> 11:21.143
Yes, a Letter of Annulment.

11:21.193 --> 11:22.593
Zhan, look.

11:25.503 --> 11:27.023
Thank you, Father.

11:28.663 --> 11:30.303
How wonderful, Zhan.

11:40.593 --> 11:41.573
Withdraw the charges?

11:41.593 --> 11:42.693
Yes.

11:42.713 --> 11:44.023
Did Duke An's family

11:44.023 --> 11:45.053
threaten you?

11:45.073 --> 11:47.693
No, My Lord, I want this.

11:47.713 --> 11:48.593
This morning,

11:48.593 --> 11:50.593
my father retrieved
the Letter of Annulment

11:50.593 --> 11:52.303
from Duke An's Mansion.

12:01.353 --> 12:02.713
Miss Jiang,

12:03.153 --> 12:05.473
I saw your composure before danger

12:05.493 --> 12:07.553
in court.

12:07.573 --> 12:08.893
Unlike an ordinary woman,

12:08.893 --> 12:10.873
you possess the spirit of a great man.

12:10.893 --> 12:13.693
Why withdraw now?

12:14.413 --> 12:15.973
My Lord, you flatter me.

12:16.093 --> 12:16.933
I'm just

12:16.953 --> 12:18.473
an ordinary woman.

12:18.493 --> 12:19.973
I simply didn't want to marry a jerk

12:19.973 --> 12:21.673
and regret it for the rest of my life.

12:21.693 --> 12:22.733
From the very beginning,

12:22.733 --> 12:24.633
I only considered myself,

12:24.653 --> 12:26.433
not any great cause.

12:26.453 --> 12:27.893
Since Duke An's family

12:27.893 --> 12:29.713
has written the Letter of Annulment,

12:29.733 --> 12:32.133
my goal has been achieved.

12:50.093 --> 12:52.213
Miss Jiang, that's not true.

12:53.253 --> 12:55.573
If Qiaoniang's testimony is true,

12:55.613 --> 12:57.133
I could charge Ji Chongyi

12:57.133 --> 12:58.573
with attempted murder.

12:59.173 --> 13:01.273
Marriage is the union of good families.

13:01.293 --> 13:03.133
According to our law,

13:03.213 --> 13:04.793
if one party commits a crime,

13:04.813 --> 13:06.153
the other party

13:06.173 --> 13:07.893
may break the engagement.

13:09.613 --> 13:10.753
No, My Lord.

13:10.773 --> 13:13.633
Ji Chongyi never meant to harm me.

13:13.653 --> 13:15.453
It was just an accident.

13:17.733 --> 13:19.053
I heard

13:19.053 --> 13:20.693
Duchess An recently

13:20.693 --> 13:22.613
went to see Sun Qiaoniang.

13:23.813 --> 13:25.833
Did she bribe Qiaoniang?

13:25.853 --> 13:27.233
Bribing a witness

13:27.253 --> 13:28.813
is also against the law.

13:29.573 --> 13:31.153
No, My Lord.

13:31.173 --> 13:33.133
It was just an accident.

13:45.053 --> 13:45.973
How is it, Father?

13:45.973 --> 13:47.333
Is it tasty?

13:47.813 --> 13:49.053
Your cooking

13:49.053 --> 13:51.453
is getting better and better.

13:51.933 --> 13:53.853
I'll make more delicious food for you.

13:53.853 --> 13:55.773
Good, good.

13:55.893 --> 13:56.993
Father,

13:57.013 --> 13:58.873
did everything go smoothly

13:58.893 --> 14:00.173
at Duke An's Mansion yesterday?

14:00.173 --> 14:01.853
They were immoral

14:01.853 --> 14:02.893
and disrespectful.

14:02.893 --> 14:03.793
After my arrival,

14:03.813 --> 14:05.493
I didn't want to talk with them.

14:05.493 --> 14:07.133
I just took the Letter of Annulment

14:07.133 --> 14:08.313
and left.

14:08.333 --> 14:09.433
But

14:09.453 --> 14:10.773
when your grandmother found out

14:10.773 --> 14:13.193
about the Letter of Annulment
and the withdrawal,

14:13.213 --> 14:15.833
she punished me
by kneeling in the ancestral hall.

14:15.853 --> 14:17.473
Grandmother punished you?

14:17.493 --> 14:18.633
It's nothing.

14:18.653 --> 14:20.973
As long as you're happy,

14:20.973 --> 14:22.533
it's all worth it.

14:23.253 --> 14:24.793
You're not young anymore.

14:24.813 --> 14:26.473
She shouldn't have done that.

14:26.573 --> 14:27.993
Si.

14:28.013 --> 14:29.073
What's wrong?

14:29.093 --> 14:30.413
I've invited Yu and Mr. Zhen

14:30.413 --> 14:31.413
to our house for dinner.

14:31.413 --> 14:33.053
They'll be here soon.
I'll go greet them.

14:33.053 --> 14:34.593
You should tidy up.

14:34.613 --> 14:36.393
Father, you should tidy up too.

14:36.613 --> 14:37.913
What did he just say?

14:37.933 --> 14:39.933
I should tidy up too?

14:50.053 --> 14:51.413
Miss,

14:52.213 --> 14:53.833
there's a pattern

14:53.853 --> 14:55.453
on the back of your neck.

14:56.093 --> 14:57.433
What about my neck?

14:57.453 --> 14:58.973
Miss, sit down.

15:03.173 --> 15:04.673
Raise it higher so I can look.

15:04.693 --> 15:05.873
This side, this side.

15:05.893 --> 15:07.493
Can you see it, Miss?

15:09.053 --> 15:10.713
- (The Saintess's Totem?)
- I don't think

15:10.713 --> 15:12.093
you had it before.

15:12.093 --> 15:13.733
(Is it because I once lived)

15:13.813 --> 15:16.133
(in Nanwu?)

15:17.573 --> 15:23.533
(Border between Dazhou and Nanwu)

15:33.813 --> 15:35.493
- Wake up.
- Water.

15:36.013 --> 15:37.033
What?

15:37.053 --> 15:39.053
- Water.
- Water?

15:43.573 --> 15:44.933
Here.

15:49.093 --> 15:50.453
How do you feel?

15:56.493 --> 15:57.593
Are you from Dazhou?

15:57.613 --> 15:58.953
I am.

15:58.973 --> 16:00.533
But don't worry.

16:00.773 --> 16:02.373
I won't report this.

16:11.013 --> 16:13.233
This medicine can stop the bleeding.

16:13.253 --> 16:15.273
I've left the water

16:15.293 --> 16:16.913
and medicine here for you.

16:16.933 --> 16:18.693
This is all I can do.

16:26.413 --> 16:27.853
Be careful.

16:35.173 --> 16:38.573
(Several months later)

16:40.133 --> 16:44.493
(Nanwu)

16:44.693 --> 16:46.433
There seems to be someone here.

16:49.293 --> 16:50.893
She's from Dazhou.

16:51.893 --> 16:53.093
Did she fall

16:53.093 --> 16:55.293
from the cliff?

16:57.293 --> 16:59.013
She's lucky to be alive.

17:04.933 --> 17:06.313
She once saved me.

17:06.333 --> 17:07.873
Now, she's gravely injured.

17:07.893 --> 17:09.253
Let's take her back.

17:22.013 --> 17:23.533
(Grand Elder, Nanwu)
Today,

17:23.533 --> 17:25.573
I will accept you as my disciple.

17:25.693 --> 17:27.653
I was forced to jump off the cliff,

17:27.853 --> 17:29.473
and it was you who saved me.

17:29.493 --> 17:31.353
Ignoring the grudges,

17:31.373 --> 17:32.913
you accept me as a disciple

17:32.933 --> 17:34.653
and teach me your skills.

17:35.213 --> 17:37.213
Please accept this.

17:40.733 --> 17:42.373
The Nanwu people

17:42.613 --> 17:44.693
do not usually save people
from Dazhou,

17:44.813 --> 17:48.093
but you saved Du'er

17:48.133 --> 17:49.773
despite the grudges.

17:49.933 --> 17:52.373
Now, we're even.

17:52.453 --> 17:54.673
From now on,

17:54.693 --> 17:57.613
you cannot have any contact
with Dazhou.

17:59.493 --> 18:01.053
I have no place

18:01.733 --> 18:03.813
in Dazhou anymore.

18:06.093 --> 18:07.933
I'm willing to stay in Nanwu.

18:21.613 --> 18:22.693
Mr. Zhen, Yu.

18:22.693 --> 18:23.953
Please come in.

18:23.973 --> 18:24.973
It's truly an honor

18:24.973 --> 18:27.553
to have you both here.

18:27.573 --> 18:28.913
Father, Si.

18:28.933 --> 18:30.853
Mr. Zhen and Yu are here.

18:31.773 --> 18:33.733
Welcome, welcome.

18:34.213 --> 18:36.573
Please come in.

18:38.333 --> 18:40.073
I must thank Mr. Zhen for judging fairly

18:40.093 --> 18:42.773
on my daughter's annulment.

18:42.773 --> 18:44.173
Mr. Yu, thanks for finding witnesses

18:44.173 --> 18:45.453
for my daughter.

18:45.453 --> 18:48.053
Thank you, thank you.

18:48.573 --> 18:50.193
You embarrass me now.

18:50.213 --> 18:51.853
I didn't help much.

18:52.213 --> 18:53.073
Your Grace,

18:53.093 --> 18:55.193
I was just doing my duty.

18:55.213 --> 18:56.753
If I had not judged fairly,

18:56.753 --> 18:57.933
it would've broken the hearts

18:57.933 --> 19:00.213
of the people of Ling'an.

19:00.613 --> 19:01.553
Miss Jiang,

19:01.573 --> 19:03.473
whenever you change your mind,

19:03.493 --> 19:05.453
I'm still willing to help you pursue

19:05.453 --> 19:07.673
the charge of attempted murder
against Duke An's son.

19:07.693 --> 19:09.773
Thank you for your efforts, My Lord.

19:10.013 --> 19:11.333
It's quite hot today.

19:11.333 --> 19:12.533
We've prepared some cool tea

19:12.533 --> 19:13.673
and snacks at home.

19:13.693 --> 19:15.233
Why don't we go

19:15.253 --> 19:16.133
and enjoy them?

19:16.133 --> 19:17.793
- Yes.
- You're too kind.

19:17.813 --> 19:18.753
No need for that.

19:18.773 --> 19:20.433
You're too kind.

19:20.453 --> 19:22.733
Did you just say it was hot

19:22.733 --> 19:23.833
and you wanted to buy

19:23.853 --> 19:25.473
some fruit?

19:25.493 --> 19:26.973
Thank you, Miss Jiang.

19:28.133 --> 19:30.093
Please come inside.

19:30.093 --> 19:32.973
(Morning Drizzle)

19:32.973 --> 19:35.053
(Haitang Chamber)

19:59.413 --> 20:01.233
Mount Shenjian in Nanwu?

20:01.253 --> 20:03.593
But from what I've heard,

20:03.613 --> 20:04.693
Miss Jiang and her brother

20:04.693 --> 20:06.313
have never left Ling'an,

20:06.333 --> 20:08.173
let alone gone to Mount Shenjian.

20:08.173 --> 20:09.453
So, why does she know about it?

20:09.453 --> 20:11.393
She even drew herself in the painting.

20:11.413 --> 20:13.573
Are you saying the girl
in the painting is Miss Jiang?

20:13.573 --> 20:14.833
Yes.

20:14.853 --> 20:15.973
Why can't I tell

20:15.973 --> 20:17.473
that this is Miss Jiang?

20:17.493 --> 20:19.093
You don't need to tell.

20:19.113 --> 20:20.673
You won't be able to tell.

20:22.573 --> 20:23.373
Chief,

20:23.393 --> 20:24.533
I think we should be careful

20:24.533 --> 20:26.333
not to get entangled
in this investigation.

20:26.333 --> 20:28.913
She must've been to Mount Shenjian

20:28.933 --> 20:31.453
to paint it so clearly.

20:35.773 --> 20:37.493
Chief, look here.

20:37.573 --> 20:39.273
There are two horses in the painting,

20:39.293 --> 20:40.793
yet only one person is riding one.

20:40.813 --> 20:42.093
We need to find

20:42.093 --> 20:43.653
more clues

20:43.733 --> 20:45.853
to solve this mystery.

20:57.733 --> 20:59.093
Aman.

20:59.293 --> 21:00.653
Aman.

21:00.933 --> 21:02.413
Coming, Miss.

21:03.293 --> 21:04.773
Did you see the painting on the table?

21:04.773 --> 21:06.373
No.

21:19.253 --> 21:20.813
Help me with something.

21:20.853 --> 21:21.993
(Maybe Yu Qi)

21:22.013 --> 21:23.913
(has been trying to get close to me)

21:23.933 --> 21:26.333
(to investigate my identity
as the Saintess.)

22:29.053 --> 22:30.973
Miss, the pattern is gone.

22:33.453 --> 22:35.373
Si.

22:36.293 --> 22:37.293
Zhan, what's wrong?

22:37.293 --> 22:38.573
Si, Yu has moved in.

22:38.573 --> 22:40.453
Let's go congratulate him.

22:40.733 --> 22:42.373
You can go by yourself.

22:42.973 --> 22:45.633
- Aman, get some paper for me.
- Yes.

22:45.653 --> 22:46.673
Si.

22:46.693 --> 22:48.453
Yu is new here.

22:48.453 --> 22:49.953
He doesn't know anyone,

22:49.973 --> 22:52.273
and he hasn't made any friends.

22:52.293 --> 22:53.613
He specially

22:53.613 --> 22:54.673
invited me.

22:54.693 --> 22:56.693
What an honor this is.

22:56.853 --> 22:57.773
Besides,

22:57.773 --> 22:59.013
he just saved

22:59.013 --> 23:01.213
our lives.

23:02.253 --> 23:03.493
Just go without me.

23:03.493 --> 23:04.853
Well...

23:06.413 --> 23:09.233
I can go on my own.

23:09.253 --> 23:11.613
But if we go together,

23:11.613 --> 23:13.453
won't that show

23:13.453 --> 23:15.353
how prestigious

23:15.373 --> 23:17.233
and impressive our family is?

23:17.253 --> 23:18.793
Zhan, stop persuading me.

23:18.813 --> 23:20.493
I'm going to start painting.

23:23.293 --> 23:24.653
Si.

23:24.733 --> 23:26.693
Tell me the truth.

23:26.973 --> 23:29.213
Did that Yu ever bully you?

23:29.773 --> 23:31.133
What are you saying?

23:31.133 --> 23:32.233
What gives you that idea?

23:32.253 --> 23:33.293
I just feel

23:33.293 --> 23:35.033
you have hostility towards him,

23:35.053 --> 23:36.793
but I can't figure out

23:36.813 --> 23:39.253
what he's done to offend you.

23:40.013 --> 23:41.673
Is it because

23:41.693 --> 23:43.073
he's an uncouth fighter?

23:43.073 --> 23:44.713
So you don't want to associate with him?

23:44.713 --> 23:46.653
Since when have I ever
looked down on fighters?

23:46.653 --> 23:48.193
You must tell me the truth.

23:48.213 --> 23:49.653
Even if he saved my life,

23:49.653 --> 23:50.733
this is different.

23:50.733 --> 23:51.693
If he bullies you,

23:51.693 --> 23:53.693
I'll go beat him today.

23:54.573 --> 23:56.333
Who are you going to beat?

23:56.453 --> 23:57.373
You don't believe me?

23:57.373 --> 23:58.853
I believe you.

23:58.893 --> 23:59.733
Let's go, Aman.

23:59.733 --> 24:00.573
Let's go out.

24:00.573 --> 24:02.213
- Yes.
- Great.

24:04.573 --> 24:06.473
This flower is beautiful.

24:06.493 --> 24:09.253
Si, you can add it to the gift list.

24:09.813 --> 24:11.173
Give it to me.

24:11.773 --> 24:13.053
Young Master Zhan,

24:13.053 --> 24:14.253
you can give favors,

24:14.253 --> 24:16.333
but why use my lady's treasure for it?

24:16.333 --> 24:19.013
Miss Jiang planted this begonia.

24:19.653 --> 24:20.553
Si,

24:20.573 --> 24:22.573
I've chosen quite a few treasures,

24:22.593 --> 24:23.853
but however exquisite tools are,

24:23.853 --> 24:26.153
they are still vulgar.

24:26.173 --> 24:27.353
Look at this flower.

24:27.373 --> 24:29.973
You've arranged it so elegantly.

24:29.973 --> 24:31.293
If we add this to the gift list,

24:31.293 --> 24:32.933
it combines both elegance
and simplicity.

24:32.933 --> 24:33.853
That would be perfect.

24:33.873 --> 24:34.653
Young Master Zhan,

24:34.653 --> 24:35.813
since you've prepared gifts,

24:35.813 --> 24:37.113
please leave this begonia alone.

24:37.113 --> 24:39.033
My sister hasn't said anything...

24:39.573 --> 24:40.713
Si,

24:40.733 --> 24:43.033
the gift I chose is my gesture.

24:43.053 --> 24:45.493
You can't go empty-handed.

24:47.493 --> 24:48.713
For now,

24:48.733 --> 24:49.653
it seems

24:49.653 --> 24:51.453
there's no more fitting gift.

24:51.613 --> 24:53.093
Miss...

24:54.693 --> 24:56.233
We'll have to make do for now.

24:56.253 --> 24:57.493
Just do as Zhan says.

24:57.493 --> 24:59.213
Yu, congrats on moving in.

24:59.213 --> 25:00.973
Thank you.
It's even livelier with you here.

25:00.973 --> 25:02.373
I've picked out some items for you

25:02.373 --> 25:03.993
to decorate your new home.

25:04.013 --> 25:06.193
You're too kind.

25:06.213 --> 25:08.293
We're friends after all.

25:08.733 --> 25:09.873
Thank you.

25:09.893 --> 25:11.873
Yu, you don't know this.

25:11.893 --> 25:13.853
My sister and I

25:13.853 --> 25:14.733
are very happy

25:14.733 --> 25:16.233
to be neighbors with you.

25:16.253 --> 25:17.413
I feel the same.

25:17.413 --> 25:18.773
It's made everything convenient.

25:18.773 --> 25:21.493
My sister prepared a gift for you.

25:29.893 --> 25:31.473
This is far from small.

25:31.493 --> 25:33.033
Even in our lady's courtyard,

25:33.053 --> 25:35.053
it's of the finest quality.

25:35.253 --> 25:36.613
Let me see.

25:37.933 --> 25:40.213
Isn't this just a flower?

25:40.693 --> 25:42.273
You don't know this.

25:42.293 --> 25:43.213
This begonia

25:43.213 --> 25:45.273
was planted by our lady,

25:45.293 --> 25:47.613
carefully nurtured day and night.

25:48.493 --> 25:50.053
Even the trimming style

25:50.053 --> 25:51.853
was designed

25:51.853 --> 25:53.193
before it was cut.

25:53.213 --> 25:54.073
Our chief has seen

25:54.093 --> 25:55.853
various precious flowers...

25:59.013 --> 26:00.813
Miss, I told you not to give it to them.

26:00.813 --> 26:01.713
Alright, Aman.

26:01.723 --> 26:03.213
Put the flower down.

26:03.893 --> 26:05.253
Goodbye.

26:06.813 --> 26:08.213
Si...

26:10.293 --> 26:11.653
Yu, don't take offense.

26:11.653 --> 26:13.373
It's okay.

26:14.413 --> 26:15.773
Chief.

26:16.093 --> 26:17.793
It's really nice.

26:17.813 --> 26:19.653
Yu, there's more.

26:19.653 --> 26:20.973
- Come here.
- There's more?

26:20.973 --> 26:22.933
Yes, there's plenty more.

26:23.133 --> 26:24.433
What's so good about it?

26:24.453 --> 26:26.113
You brought so many gifts.

26:26.133 --> 26:27.133
How nice.

26:27.133 --> 26:28.013
The items I brought

26:28.013 --> 26:29.813
are all useful, Yu.

26:30.173 --> 26:31.593
Ji,

26:31.613 --> 26:32.813
bring over the loong

26:32.813 --> 26:33.753
and phoenix vase.

26:33.773 --> 26:34.713
Yu,

26:34.733 --> 26:35.813
if you place

26:35.813 --> 26:37.033
this vase here,

26:37.053 --> 26:38.393
it may look vulgar.

26:38.413 --> 26:40.373
- But actually...
- How elegant.

26:40.733 --> 26:41.673
It not only

26:41.693 --> 26:42.873
looks beautiful here

26:42.893 --> 26:44.253
but also

26:44.493 --> 26:45.933
brings good fortune.

26:46.013 --> 26:47.013
Place it here.

26:47.013 --> 26:48.373
Alright.

26:50.173 --> 26:51.573
Er'niu, you're here to help, right?

26:51.573 --> 26:53.293
Give it to me.

26:53.413 --> 26:54.773
Good dog.

26:59.013 --> 27:01.113
Why do the brushstrokes in this painting

27:01.573 --> 27:03.613
look so much like my sister's?

27:03.893 --> 27:05.253
Really?

27:05.573 --> 27:06.453
Does Miss Jiang

27:06.453 --> 27:08.133
have such talent?

27:10.173 --> 27:11.973
But my sister only paints
flowers and birds,

27:11.973 --> 27:13.333
not landscapes.

27:14.613 --> 27:15.953
Yu,

27:15.973 --> 27:18.113
who is the woman in this painting?

27:18.133 --> 27:19.813
How would I know?

27:21.173 --> 27:22.013
She's not your lover?

27:22.013 --> 27:23.053
No.

27:23.053 --> 27:24.413
No?

27:24.853 --> 27:26.453
Don't be shy.

27:33.493 --> 27:34.973
The token of Tianxiang House.

27:34.973 --> 27:36.613
Don't deny it.

27:37.293 --> 27:38.653
Tianxiang House?

27:41.373 --> 27:44.293
The best brothel in Ling'an.

27:47.573 --> 27:48.933
Long Dan,

27:49.143 --> 27:51.213
don't put your things on my table.

27:51.453 --> 27:52.813
They're not yours?

27:55.853 --> 27:57.373
Got it, got it.

27:57.373 --> 27:59.213
Come on, let's look at the vase.

28:00.573 --> 28:01.313
This morning,

28:01.333 --> 28:03.053
someone from Cixin Hall
came to invite you.

28:03.053 --> 28:04.073
It can't be anything good.

28:04.093 --> 28:04.933
If you ask me,

28:04.933 --> 28:06.413
you might as well find an excuse

28:06.413 --> 28:07.113
and not go.

28:07.133 --> 28:08.693
Grandmother sent someone to invite me.

28:08.693 --> 28:10.433
If I don't have a valid reason,

28:10.453 --> 28:11.773
as a granddaughter,

28:11.773 --> 28:13.653
I don't have the right to refuse.

28:14.053 --> 28:15.233
Moreover,

28:15.253 --> 28:16.413
Grandmother is still upset

28:16.413 --> 28:18.593
about the annulment,

28:18.613 --> 28:20.653
waiting to take it out on us.

28:21.253 --> 28:22.753
So, are we going?

28:22.773 --> 28:24.933
If we go, we'll definitely be mocked.

28:26.093 --> 28:27.713
I don't mind

28:27.733 --> 28:29.313
how Grandmother treats me.

28:29.453 --> 28:30.693
I just don't want Grandmother

28:30.693 --> 28:33.033
to punish Father because of me.

28:33.053 --> 28:35.933
He's not young anymore.

28:39.133 --> 28:40.833
Grandmother should be happy.

28:40.833 --> 28:42.613
Nothing is more important
than your health.

28:42.613 --> 28:43.473
Miss,

28:43.493 --> 28:45.373
sounds like Ms. Jiang Qian's voice.

28:45.933 --> 28:48.353
You're so sweet.

28:48.373 --> 28:49.293
Ms. Jiang Qian,

28:49.293 --> 28:50.793
you should come back often.

28:50.813 --> 28:51.653
When you're back,

28:51.673 --> 28:53.573
Lady Jiang's mood improves.

28:53.593 --> 28:54.773
(Jiang Qian)
I'll often come

28:54.773 --> 28:57.093
(Wife of Marquis Changxing's heir)
to visit Grandmother.

28:57.113 --> 28:59.353
Grandmother, have some tea.

29:00.893 --> 29:02.413
Greetings, Grandmother.

29:10.053 --> 29:11.453
(Jiang Qian...)

29:12.093 --> 29:13.493
(Why?)

29:19.333 --> 29:21.293
Why are you coughing again?

29:24.573 --> 29:26.753
Miss, the medicine is ready.

29:26.773 --> 29:28.053
Give it to me.

29:28.053 --> 29:29.413
Yes.

29:32.453 --> 29:33.613
Qian, drink the medicine

29:33.613 --> 29:35.053
while it's hot.

29:38.093 --> 29:39.613
It's not bitter.

29:40.093 --> 29:41.213
Then I'll get you

29:41.213 --> 29:42.813
some fruit.

29:46.893 --> 29:48.253
Xingyu.

29:54.173 --> 29:55.533
Xingyu.

29:58.573 --> 29:59.413
Qian!

29:59.413 --> 30:01.073
Why are you calling your sister?

30:01.093 --> 30:02.553
She's sleeping.

30:02.573 --> 30:04.093
I'll keep you company.

30:04.213 --> 30:05.093
Qian!

30:05.093 --> 30:06.493
Stop shouting.

30:07.313 --> 30:08.173
What took you so long?

30:08.173 --> 30:09.793
Let go of me, let go of me!

30:09.813 --> 30:10.653
Don't shout.

30:10.653 --> 30:11.393
Help!

30:11.413 --> 30:12.493
I told you to come earlier.

30:12.493 --> 30:13.793
Qian.

30:13.813 --> 30:15.153
Qian.

30:15.173 --> 30:16.533
Let go of me.

30:24.893 --> 30:26.253
Qian.

30:31.733 --> 30:33.213
Jiang Si,

30:33.333 --> 30:35.153
I've waited for you so long.

30:35.173 --> 30:36.813
You can't escape.

30:37.613 --> 30:39.053
Qian.

30:39.893 --> 30:43.693
Can't you see your sister is helping me?

30:44.933 --> 30:46.333
Come here.

30:47.693 --> 30:49.093
Qian.

30:49.573 --> 30:51.073
If you don't come,

30:51.093 --> 30:52.853
I'll go to you.

30:58.613 --> 31:00.213
Qian!

31:01.333 --> 31:02.653
Let go of me.

31:02.653 --> 31:03.673
You smell so good.

31:03.693 --> 31:04.613
Let go of me.

31:04.613 --> 31:05.673
Still want to run?

31:05.693 --> 31:07.093
(Why?)

31:07.173 --> 31:09.833
(Why would a woman help her husband)

31:09.853 --> 31:11.253
- (hurt her sister?)
- Your sister

31:11.253 --> 31:12.833
specifically came to see you.

31:12.853 --> 31:14.033
Si.

31:14.053 --> 31:15.553
Where are your manners?

31:15.573 --> 31:16.773
You don't even greet

31:16.773 --> 31:19.093
your sister?

31:19.973 --> 31:21.333
Qian.

31:21.853 --> 31:22.993
Don't stand there.

31:23.013 --> 31:25.213
Come and sit down.

31:30.453 --> 31:32.793
Si, long time no see.

31:32.813 --> 31:34.353
I've really missed you.

31:34.373 --> 31:36.093
Sorry for making you suffer.

31:38.293 --> 31:39.913
I didn't suffer.

31:39.933 --> 31:41.793
You don't need to pity me.

31:41.813 --> 31:43.453
Si.

31:44.093 --> 31:45.773
Grandmother, don't be angry.

31:46.093 --> 31:47.873
Si feels upset

31:47.893 --> 31:49.613
because of the annulment.

31:50.183 --> 31:51.543
No.

31:51.813 --> 31:53.473
I'm actually fine.

31:53.493 --> 31:54.833
It's you

31:54.853 --> 31:56.773
who keeps bringing it up

31:57.013 --> 31:58.233
that makes me upset.

31:58.253 --> 31:59.693
Si,

31:59.713 --> 32:01.793
why can't you appreciate
someone's kindness?

32:01.813 --> 32:03.613
After Qian knew about your situation,

32:03.613 --> 32:05.133
she immediately came to see you.

32:05.133 --> 32:05.973
But you

32:05.983 --> 32:07.773
aren't grateful at all.

32:07.773 --> 32:10.113
Hurry and apologize to Qian.

32:10.133 --> 32:11.353
Grandmother,

32:11.373 --> 32:12.333
I haven't fought

32:12.333 --> 32:14.113
or argued with her.

32:14.133 --> 32:15.633
Why should I apologize to her

32:15.653 --> 32:17.393
for no reason?

32:17.413 --> 32:18.673
Qian,

32:18.693 --> 32:20.553
did I offend you?

32:20.573 --> 32:22.013
No.

32:22.573 --> 32:24.333
Have I reminded you

32:24.333 --> 32:25.633
of Yi?

32:25.653 --> 32:27.393
Is that why you're upset?

32:27.413 --> 32:28.913
If I miss Yi,

32:28.933 --> 32:30.473
I'd go see her.

32:30.493 --> 32:32.493
It's between Yi and me.

32:32.613 --> 32:34.293
No need for you to worry.

32:34.293 --> 32:35.553
Si,

32:35.573 --> 32:37.293
you're lacking manners,

32:37.293 --> 32:38.933
always targeting Qian.

32:38.933 --> 32:40.453
Should I bring down the family penalty?

32:40.453 --> 32:42.193
Grandmother, please calm down.

32:43.253 --> 32:45.073
It's getting late.

32:45.093 --> 32:47.353
I'm busy back home.

32:47.373 --> 32:48.913
I should return.

32:48.933 --> 32:50.553
You should return to work.

32:50.573 --> 32:53.093
You're married now,
not as free as before.

32:53.773 --> 32:55.573
I'll leave first.

32:55.573 --> 32:56.493
Take care of yourself.

32:56.493 --> 32:58.373
Live well.

33:03.373 --> 33:05.293
Si, please walk me out.

33:07.733 --> 33:09.313
After this time apart,

33:09.333 --> 33:10.493
I feel like

33:10.493 --> 33:12.393
you've become distant.

33:12.413 --> 33:14.413
Qian, you must be mistaken.

33:15.613 --> 33:16.753
That's good.

33:16.773 --> 33:19.213
Glad we're still close.

33:19.813 --> 33:22.653
I know you've been feeling down lately.

33:22.813 --> 33:24.073
How about this?

33:24.093 --> 33:25.513
I'll send you an invitation,

33:25.533 --> 33:27.133
and you can stay with me for a few days.

33:27.133 --> 33:28.073
What do you think?

33:28.093 --> 33:30.413
I'll invite the other sisters too.

33:35.873 --> 33:38.253
Why are you looking at me like that?

33:39.573 --> 33:42.213
Do I have something on my face?

33:49.133 --> 33:51.013
During the fighting match days ago,

33:51.013 --> 33:52.933
my husband accidentally injured Zhan.

33:52.933 --> 33:54.613
I've heard about it.

33:55.053 --> 33:57.353
Si, are you angry?

33:57.373 --> 33:59.313
People can get out of control
in contests,

33:59.333 --> 34:00.933
let alone Xingyu.

34:01.573 --> 34:02.793
Perfect timing.

34:02.813 --> 34:04.813
If you come to our place,

34:04.853 --> 34:05.813
I'll have Xingyu

34:05.813 --> 34:07.613
apologize to you.

34:07.653 --> 34:09.013
No need.

34:10.693 --> 34:12.053
Yi will be back soon.

34:12.053 --> 34:14.053
I'll stay at home waiting for her.

34:15.133 --> 34:16.673
Come to my place for now.

34:16.693 --> 34:17.973
Once Yi arrives,

34:17.993 --> 34:19.493
I'll send you back. How about that?

34:19.493 --> 34:20.853
Didn't you just say

34:20.853 --> 34:21.933
you're busy

34:21.933 --> 34:22.953
back at home?

34:22.973 --> 34:24.273
If you don't return,

34:24.293 --> 34:25.953
Xingyu will get worried.

34:25.973 --> 34:27.853
Ma'am, the things are packed.

34:27.853 --> 34:29.413
We can leave now.

34:33.653 --> 34:34.753
Alright then.

34:34.773 --> 34:36.113
If you want to come,

34:36.133 --> 34:37.613
you're always welcome.

34:55.773 --> 34:58.033
Your younger sister's looks

34:58.053 --> 35:00.433
are truly extraordinary.

35:00.453 --> 35:02.293
She's so delicate.

35:02.333 --> 35:04.733
Such a beauty.

35:06.133 --> 35:08.733
How unlucky Ji Chongyi is.

35:16.013 --> 35:19.133
Tomorrow, go to your maiden home,

35:19.573 --> 35:20.953
visit Miss Si,

35:20.973 --> 35:23.013
and invite her to our home

35:23.253 --> 35:24.613
to relax.

35:29.773 --> 35:31.253
What do you want?

35:31.893 --> 35:33.733
She's my sister.

35:35.413 --> 35:36.773
What?

35:37.493 --> 35:38.853
Are you refusing me?

36:02.853 --> 36:05.473
I'll ask you one last time.

36:05.493 --> 36:08.773
Will you go or not?

36:16.923 --> 36:22.713
♪ Life is like flowers,
blooming and fading with the seasons ♪

36:23.343 --> 36:28.693
♪ Wind leaves marks,
swaying in the breeze ♪

36:29.163 --> 36:32.303
♪ I don't wish for favors
from the heavens ♪

36:32.323 --> 36:35.273
♪ To enjoy a blessed life ♪

36:35.553 --> 36:42.273
♪ I only wish to be unburdened ♪

36:42.733 --> 36:49.163
♪ Alas, is it too late
to stop indulging myself ♪

36:49.183 --> 36:55.563
♪ Is it too difficult
to be free from sorrow ♪

36:55.583 --> 36:58.753
♪ How many regrets are left ♪

36:58.773 --> 37:02.513
♪ To be remedied ♪

37:02.533 --> 37:08.433
♪ A small greed forms
an unbreakable tie ♪

37:11.573 --> 37:13.893
Everything is sent by Ms. Jiang Yi.

37:22.373 --> 37:24.333
To Si, my dear sister:

37:24.773 --> 37:27.693
All things are peaceful
when you feel calm.

37:27.733 --> 37:29.173
Don't waste time crying

37:29.173 --> 37:31.113
for unworthy people.

37:31.133 --> 37:32.433
The man for you will come

37:32.453 --> 37:33.953
with a bright future.

37:33.973 --> 37:35.573
You should wait.

37:36.093 --> 37:37.873
Sorry for not coming in person.

37:37.893 --> 37:39.713
I feel guilty.

37:39.733 --> 37:41.333
Please don't blame me.

37:41.353 --> 37:43.373
(Jiang Yi, Jiang Si's eldest sister)
When we meet,

37:43.373 --> 37:45.053
we can talk about everything.

37:45.573 --> 37:47.133
May you be healthy.

37:48.653 --> 37:49.873
(Last time, )

37:49.893 --> 37:51.813
(soon after Yi got divorced)

37:52.133 --> 37:54.253
(and returned home, )

37:54.813 --> 37:56.573
(she poisoned herself and died.)

37:57.373 --> 37:59.053
(She was only 20)

37:59.573 --> 38:01.533
(when she died.)

38:04.013 --> 38:05.413
(Yi, )

38:05.733 --> 38:07.213
(this time, )

38:07.613 --> 38:09.733
(no one can hurt you.)

38:17.853 --> 38:20.133
- Did you see a child like this?
- No.

38:20.413 --> 38:22.253
Hey, have you seen my daughter?

38:22.253 --> 38:23.213
- She's Niuniu.
- No.

38:23.213 --> 38:25.053
Have you seen Niuniu?

38:25.053 --> 38:26.433
- Is she that mad woman?
- No.

38:26.453 --> 38:27.873
It seems like Ms. Xiu.

38:27.893 --> 38:29.433
She's looking for her child every day.

38:29.453 --> 38:31.013
- She's gone mad.
- Niuniu.

38:31.023 --> 38:32.313
This mad woman

38:32.333 --> 38:33.573
- is a tofu seller.
- Niuniu.

38:33.573 --> 38:34.833
People call her the Tofu Beauty.

38:34.853 --> 38:36.393
- She's a widow.
- Have you seen her?

38:36.393 --> 38:38.533
- She raised her daughter alone.
- She's this tall.

38:38.553 --> 38:39.263
But her daughter

38:39.283 --> 38:40.203
- went missing.
- Sir.

38:40.203 --> 38:41.293
- Have you seen her?
- No.

38:41.293 --> 38:42.653
She's so pitiful.

38:52.373 --> 38:53.713
Niuniu.

38:53.733 --> 38:54.753
Niuniu.

38:54.773 --> 38:56.373
You're Niuniu.

38:56.893 --> 38:57.973
She's not your daughter.

38:57.993 --> 38:59.273
- This is my lady.
- Step aside.

38:59.293 --> 39:01.053
- Aman.
- Niuniu.

39:01.133 --> 39:02.353
Niuniu.

39:02.373 --> 39:04.073
Where did you go?

39:04.093 --> 39:05.533
Ma'am,

39:05.893 --> 39:07.293
you got it wrong.

39:07.733 --> 39:09.733
(Ms. Xiu)

39:09.733 --> 39:11.333
You look just like her.

39:11.453 --> 39:12.973
You look just like her.

39:13.133 --> 39:14.413
When other kids

39:14.413 --> 39:15.913
went out to play,

39:15.933 --> 39:17.893
she never joined them.

39:17.933 --> 39:20.793
She was always making tofu with me.

39:20.813 --> 39:22.853
Before she went missing,

39:22.853 --> 39:24.693
she never got to enjoy herself.

39:25.053 --> 39:26.773
She said she'd come back
after selling tofu

39:26.773 --> 39:29.053
at Marquis Changxing's Mansion.

39:29.613 --> 39:31.753
Where did she go?

39:31.773 --> 39:32.993
Niuniu.

39:33.013 --> 39:35.013
Niuniu.

39:36.573 --> 39:38.013
Niuniu.

39:39.413 --> 39:40.813
Where are you, Niuniu?

39:40.813 --> 39:42.173
I'm not her.

39:43.933 --> 39:45.773
Niuniu.

39:45.893 --> 39:47.453
Have you seen a child like this?

39:47.453 --> 39:48.813
No.

39:53.973 --> 39:56.013
Marquis Changxing's Mansion.

39:58.213 --> 40:00.673
Aman, get me paper and an envelope.

40:00.693 --> 40:02.053
Yes.

40:06.213 --> 40:08.733
(Niuniu looks a little like me.)

40:10.613 --> 40:12.233
(The last place she went)

40:12.253 --> 40:14.173
(was Marquis Changxing's Mansion.)

40:22.133 --> 40:23.673
(If I'm not mistaken, )

40:23.693 --> 40:25.013
(that innocent girl)

40:25.013 --> 40:26.773
(must've gone missing)

40:26.793 --> 40:28.093
(at Marquis Changxing's Mansion)

40:28.093 --> 40:29.753
(because she looks like me.)

40:30.173 --> 40:32.353
(Cao Xingyu is a vile man.)

40:32.373 --> 40:33.793
(I can avoid him, )

40:33.813 --> 40:34.733
(but I can't stop him)

40:34.733 --> 40:36.413
(from hurting others.)

40:36.853 --> 40:40.373
(Qian)

40:49.293 --> 40:50.393
Aman,

40:50.413 --> 40:51.433
send this letter

40:51.453 --> 40:52.953
to Marquis Changxing's Mansion.

40:52.973 --> 40:55.993
But didn't we just refuse Ms. Jiang Qian?

40:56.013 --> 40:58.633
Do we have to go
to Marquis Changxing's Mansion?

40:58.653 --> 41:00.213
The refusal is for now.

41:01.053 --> 41:02.893
- Go ahead.
- Yes.

41:21.093 --> 41:23.753
Jiang Si, do you know?

41:23.773 --> 41:25.373
The more you struggle,

41:25.853 --> 41:27.613
the more excited I get.

41:35.693 --> 41:37.793
(That place is scarier
than a nightmare.)

41:37.813 --> 41:39.633
(However dangerous it is, )

41:39.653 --> 41:41.313
(I still have to go.)

41:41.333 --> 41:42.393
(This time, )

41:42.413 --> 41:43.673
(the evil should get)

41:43.693 --> 41:45.253
(their just deserts.)

41:46.773 --> 41:49.133
(Earl Dongping's Mansion)

41:50.893 --> 41:52.253
Si.

41:52.333 --> 41:54.253
- Zhan.
- Are you going out?

41:56.973 --> 41:59.073
Some fragrances are left
at Qiaoxiang Shop.

41:59.093 --> 42:00.913
- I'll go get them.
- What a coincidence.

42:00.933 --> 42:02.553
I was just about to leave.

42:02.573 --> 42:03.713
Let me go with you.

42:03.733 --> 42:04.573
Sure.

42:04.573 --> 42:05.913
Young Master Zhan,

42:05.933 --> 42:07.233
didn't we just return?

42:07.253 --> 42:08.093
Let's go.

42:08.093 --> 42:09.293
(West Market)

42:09.293 --> 42:10.433
Is it nice?

42:10.453 --> 42:11.813
Yes.

42:12.013 --> 42:13.073
Candied hawthorn.

42:13.093 --> 42:14.233
Candied hawthorn.

42:14.253 --> 42:15.173
Would you like one?

42:15.173 --> 42:16.953
Do you want candied hawthorn?

42:16.973 --> 42:18.473
Aman, do you want some?

42:18.493 --> 42:19.593
A little.

42:19.613 --> 42:20.873
- Here.
- Here, Si.

42:20.893 --> 42:22.533
Thank you, Miss.

42:25.133 --> 42:27.273
Young Master, you don't want it?

42:27.293 --> 42:28.433
What a joke.

42:28.453 --> 42:30.853
What man eats candied hawthorn?

42:31.253 --> 42:33.093
(Qiaoxiang Shop)
It's closed.

42:33.093 --> 42:35.213
Shall we change to another one?

42:35.413 --> 42:37.433
No need, Qiaoniang
left the door open for me.

42:37.453 --> 42:38.453
You go in first.

42:38.453 --> 42:39.473
I'll wait outside.

42:39.493 --> 42:40.333
Okay, Zhan.

42:40.333 --> 42:46.373
(Miss Jiang Si, always available)

42:49.173 --> 42:53.493
(The End of Episode 3)

42:53.943 --> 42:55.673
♪ From place to place ♪

42:55.673 --> 43:00.613
♪ I drift in the world alone ♪

43:00.983 --> 43:03.363
♪ The cool breeze comes and goes ♪

43:03.363 --> 43:07.593
♪ I dare to love and hate ♪

43:08.303 --> 43:10.703
♪ Ask the day and the night ♪

43:10.723 --> 43:14.383
♪ If they saw a glimmer fall and take root ♪

43:14.403 --> 43:17.823
♪ Growing between us ♪

43:17.973 --> 43:23.493
♪ And breeding love ♪

43:24.313 --> 43:27.993
♪ Smile at each other for the future ♪

43:27.993 --> 43:32.073
♪ In the end, we're still together ♪

43:32.313 --> 43:34.053
♪ Like shadows ♪

43:34.073 --> 43:38.773
♪ We're brave enough to advance together ♪

43:38.773 --> 43:42.343
♪ We promise each other the future ♪

43:42.363 --> 43:46.593
♪ Our bond trickles down from youth ♪

43:46.613 --> 43:48.393
♪ Time glows ♪

43:48.393 --> 43:52.933
♪ Together, we'll see light ♪

43:52.953 --> 43:57.753
♪ And stars ♪

44:01.983 --> 44:04.513
♪ Don't ask what our fate is ♪

44:04.533 --> 44:08.153
♪ Let life carve the growth rings ♪

44:08.173 --> 44:11.603
♪ We'll reach the end eventually ♪

44:11.623 --> 44:16.243
♪ All will bloom in spring ♪

44:16.243 --> 44:19.933
♪ We promise each other the future ♪

44:19.953 --> 44:24.043
♪ Our bond trickles down from youth ♪

44:24.153 --> 44:25.973
♪ Time glows ♪

44:25.973 --> 44:30.523
♪ Together, we'll see light ♪

44:30.543 --> 44:34.243
♪ Smile at each other for the future ♪

44:34.263 --> 44:38.423
♪ We travel at night in the cold ♪

44:38.603 --> 44:40.363
♪ The moonlight shines like water ♪

44:40.363 --> 44:44.883
♪ Those in love will have sweet dreams ♪

44:44.883 --> 44:48.523
♪ Cherish each other in the future ♪

44:48.543 --> 44:54.213
♪ Time goes by, but memories remain ♪

44:55.903 --> 44:57.833
♪ Take a look to remember everything ♪

44:57.833 --> 45:05.333
♪ We will see flowers fill the city again ♪
